<section class="index"><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">advanced example</p><h1>SnapFire FSR</h1><p class="lede">Plans built in Rust, Tera rendering, React islands and no JavaScript engine on the server.</p><p class="segment-render">this segment rendered at page render {{ renders }}</p></header><div class="grid routes"><a class="card route" href="/dash/servers"><code>/dash/servers</code><span>Eager render, a cached page segment and an island hydrated on load.</span></a><a class="card route" href="/slow/servers"><code>/slow/servers</code><span>A deferred segment that streams in, with an island hydrated when it becomes visible.</span></a><a class="card route" href="/dash/down"><code>/dash/down</code><span>A failing backend degrading one segment instead of the page.</span></a><a class="card route" href="/login"><code>/login</code><span>The dev login flow over the file provider.</span></a></div><p class="creds">Dev sign in: <code>alice</code> / <code>wonder</code> or <code>bob</code> / <code>builder</code>.</p></section>
